        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Open problem: UI's laptop failure (Windows hang) reduced time available to complete tasks."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#1",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Solar panels are impractical due to limited space on the remote, reducing space for the interface and for harvesting energy."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#2",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Adopt a combined power system using a rechargeable battery with kinetic energy as a back-up."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#3",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Charge the battery when the remote is moved."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#4",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The remote will use rubber casing material."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#5",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The casing must be firm and not bendable."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#6",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The touch-screen concept will be housed in a protective case to prevent breakage."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#7",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Parental control will be incorporated but not too complex and offered as a menu option."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#8",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "The remote will use a square LCD as the standard touch-screen; if LCD is used, include an advanced LCD option."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#9",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Budget constraints may force moving from advanced chip sets to simpler button solutions if costs are not manageable."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3007c#10",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Using a combination battery and kinetic charging may increase costs."
      }
